1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 g6 5. Be3 Nf6 6. Nc3 Bg7 7. Bc4 O-O 8.
Bb3 d6 9. f3 Bd7 10. O-O Na5 11. Qd2 Rc8 12. Rad1 Nc4 13. Bxc4 Rxc4 14. g4 Ne8
15. Nde2 b6 ({If} 15... a6 16. Nd5) 16. b3 Rc8 17. Nd5 e6 18. Ndf4 (18. b4 {
seems much better.}) 18... Bc6 19. c4 Qe7 20. Ng3 Rd8 21. Nd3 Nc7 ({If} 21...
d5 22. Nb4) 22. Bh6 d5 $2 {Still not playable.} 23. Bxg7 Kxg7 24. cxd5 exd5 25.
Qc3+ Qf6 26. e5 Qe6 27. Nf4 Qe8 28. e6+ $2 (28. Ngh5+ $1 gxh5 29. Nxh5+ Kh8 30.
Nf6 Qe6 31. Qd3 {is decisive and similarly if Black had played 27...Qd7.})
28... Kg8 ({Possibly better is} 28... d4 29. Rxd4 Nb5 30. Rxd8+ Nxc3 31. Rxe8
Rxe8 32. Rc1 Nd5 {and White may be able to win after} 33. Rxc6 {or 33 Nfh5+.})
29. Nfh5 gxh5 30. Nf5 d4 31. Rxd4 Nb5 (31... Rxd4 32. Qxd4 f6 33. e7 Rf7 34.
Qd8 Ne6 35. Qxe8+ Bxe8 36. Rc1) 32. Qd2 fxe6 ({Time trouble was imminent. If} 
32... Kh8 33. Rxd8 Qxd8 34. e7) 33. Qg5+ Qg6 34. Ne7+ Kf7 35. Nxg6 Nxd4 36.
Ne5+ (36. Nxf8 {wins more easily.}) 36... Ke8 37. Qxh5+ Ke7 38. Qxh7+ Kf6 39.
Nxc6 (39. f4 {gives a winning position. The rest of the game was played at
breakneck speed!}) 39... Nxc6 40. Qh6+ Ke7 41. Qg5+ Rf6 42. h4 Rd3 43. h5 Nd4
44. Qg7+ Rf7 45. Qg5+ Kd7 46. h6 Nxf3+ 47. Rxf3 Rdxf3 48. Qd2+ 1-0

