1. d4 d5 2. e4 dxe4 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. f3 exf3 5. Qxf3 Nc6 6. Be3 Bg4 7. Qf2 e6 8.
h3 Bh5 9. Bd3 Nb4 10. Bc4 Bg6 11. Bb3 Nbd5 12. Nge2 Bb4 13. O-O-O Bxc3 14. Nxc3
Nxc3 15. bxc3 Ne4 16. Qe1 Qe7 17. Kb2 c6 18. Bf4 a5 19. a3 O-O 20. h4 h6 21.
Bc4 Nd6 22. Bd3 Bxd3 23. cxd3 b5 24. Qe5 Rfd8 25. Rh3 Qf8 $2 (25... b4 $1 {
then if} 26. Bxh6 f6 27. Qg3 Nf5 {wins.}) 26. g4 b4 27. axb4 Nb5 $6 (27... axb4
$1 28. c4 b3 $1 {(threatening Nxc4+) wins.}) 28. g5 axb4 29. c4 Nc3 30. Ra1
Rxa1 31. Kxa1 Rxd4 32. Kb2 (32. Qxd4 Qa8+ {wins.}) 32... Qa8 33. Qb8+ Qxb8 34.
Bxb8 hxg5 35. hxg5 Rg4 36. Rg3 Rxg3 37. Bxg3 Kh7 38. Kb3 Ne2 39. Be5 Kg6 40.
Kxb4 Kxg5 41. Bxg7 (41. Kc5 f6 42. Bh2 Nc1 43. d4 Nb3+ 44. Kxc6 Nxd4+ {wins.})
41... f5 42. Kc5 (42. Bf8 e5 43. Bc5 {(and now the score gives 'NK5' which
makes no sense)}) (42. Be5 f4 43. Bxf4+ Nxf4 {in both cases winning.}) 42... f4
{White lost on time. The pawn queens. Source: bulletin} 0-1

