1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bc4 e6 7. Qe2 {White is
aiming for a setup similar to the Velimirovic, attack against the Scheveningen.
} Be7 8. Be3 O-O 9. Bb3 b5 10. f3 Qc7 11. O-O-O Nbd7 12. g4 Nc5 13. g5 Nfd7 14.
h4 b4 15. Nf5 $5 ({On} 15. Na4 Nxa4 16. Bxa4 Nc5 17. Bb3 Nxb3+ 18. axb3 a5 {
with equal chances.}) 15... Nxb3+ 16. axb3 exf5 (16... Bd8 17. Nd5 exd5 {
is better.}) 17. Nd5 Qd8 18. exf5 Re8 19. g6 $2 ({A slower attack with} 19. Qg2
{and Bd4 is stronger.}) 19... Bb7 20. gxf7+ Kxf7 21. Nf4 Ne5 22. Ne6 Qa5 23.
Rhg1 Bf6 24. Rxd6 Qa1+ 25. Kd2 Qxb2 26. Rg3 ({On} 26. Bd4 Nxf3+ {simplifies a
piece ahead.}) 26... Rac8 27. Kd1 Qb1+ 28. Bc1 Bxf3 29. Rxf3 Nxf3 30. Rd7+ Re7
31. Ng5+ Nxg5 0-1

