1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. g3 c5 4. d5 exd5 5. cxd5 d6 6. Nc3 g6 7. Bg2 Bg7 8. Nf3
O-O 9. O-O Re8 10. Nd2 a6 11. a4 Nbd7 12. e4 ({Actually more exact was} 12. Nc4
Ne5 13. Nxe5 Rxe5 14. Bf4 Re8 15. e4) 12... Ne5 13. Qc2 Nh5 14. f4 ({Much
better was} 14. h3 f5 15. f4 Nf7 16. Kh2 {but Black is still better.}) 14...
Ng4 15. Nf3 {To stop 15...Ne3.} f5 16. Ng5 ({If} 16. e5 dxe5 17. h3 e4 $3 18.
hxg4 fxg4 {with winning position for Black}) ({And if} 16. exf5 Bxf5 {, etc.})
16... Bd4+ 17. Kh1 fxe4 18. Bxe4 (18. Ncxe4 Bf5 $1 {White now intends 19 Bxg6
but...}) 18... Rxe4 $3 19. Ncxe4 Bf5 20. Kg2 {Best move in circumstances.
Black's idea was to proceed with Qd7, Re8 and if White moves his knight to e6
then Black plays Rxe6! and Qc6.} Qd7 21. Bd2 ({If} 21. h3 Ngf6 {then} 22. g4 (
22. Nxf6+ Nxf6 23. Qd1 h6 24. Ne6 (24. Nf3 Bxh3+) 24... Nxd5 25. Nxd4 Bxh3+ 26.
Kh2 Bxf1 27. Qf3 Qh3+ 28. Kg1 Nf6 29. Qxb7 Re8 {it's all finished.}) 22... Bxg4
23. Nxf6+ Bxf6 24. hxg4 Qxg4+ 25. Kh2 Bxg5 26. fxg5 Qg3+ 27. Kh1 Re8 28. Qg2
Qh4+ 29. Qh2 Ng3+ 30. Kg1 Qxh2+ 31. Kxh2 Nxf1+ {, etc.}) 21... h6 22. Ne6 Ngf6
23. Rae1 Nxe4 24. g4 ({A little better was} 24. Rxe4 Nf6 25. Rfe1 Nxe4 26. Rxe4
Bf6 {winning still.}) 24... Nxd2 25. gxf5 ({If} 25. Qxd2 Bxg4 {etc.}) 25...
Nxf1 26. f6 Kf7 27. Kxf1 ({If} 27. Nxd4 cxd4 28. Re7+ Qxe7 29. fxe7 Ne3+) 27...
Bxf6 28. Qe2 Ng7 29. Qg4 Nf5 0-1

